<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>D4rkScare</title><link>https://d4rkscare.github.io/</link><description>Recent content on D4rkScare</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-KR</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Mar 2026 16:54:05 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://d4rkscare.github.io/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>CCTV</title><link>https://d4rkscare.github.io/posts/htb/starting_point/cctv/</link><pubDate>Thu, 19 Mar 2026 16:54:05 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://d4rkscare.github.io/posts/htb/starting_point/cctv/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="active-machine이기에-flag는-작성하지-않습니다"&gt;Active Machine이기에 Flag는 작성하지 않습니다.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 id="인터넷-상의-풀이도-없습니다"&gt;인터넷 상의 풀이도 없습니다!&lt;/h3&gt;
